  <translations>
    <en>
      <description>Rain Bird VAN-18 is an adjustable spray nozzle for precise watering of lawns, borders and flower beds. The nozzle produces a fan-shaped spray and allows the installer to set the watering arc to suit the shape of the area. The stated radius is 4.3–5.5 m, the available arc is 0–360°, and the recommended operating pressure is 1.0–2.1 bar.

The VAN range is suitable for smaller zones and close-range watering. HE-VAN models are designed for improved application efficiency when used at the correct pressure and with a suitable layout. The radius can be fine-tuned using the adjustment screw. Always select a nozzle that matches the sprinkler body, required coverage and flow available to the zone.

Compatible with suitable Rain Bird 1800/RD1800 series spray bodies. Actual radius can vary with pressure, nozzle setting and site conditions.</description>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-h1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-h1s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Where this nozzle is best used</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p1s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Rain Bird VAN-18</text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p1s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text> is an adjustable fan-spray nozzle for precise watering of lawns, narrow areas, irregular edges and small landscaped zones. Its fan pattern can be set to follow the actual boundary of the area instead of spraying onto paving or walls.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-h2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-h2s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Technical specifications of VAN-18</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p2s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Technical data: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p2s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>radius 18-ft class, up to 5.5 m; adjustable arc 0°–360°; operating pressure 1.0–2.1 bar, with 2.1 bar optimum. Models 4, 6 and 8 adjust up to 330°, while models 10, 12, 15 and 18 adjust through a full 360° circle.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-h3</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-h3s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Arc and radius adjustment</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p3</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p3s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Adjustment: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p3s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>turn the centre collar to set the arc. The stainless-steel adjustment screw controls flow and radius, while the included blue filter screen helps prevent clogging and maintain the selected radius. A fixed left edge makes it easier to align the spray with the lawn boundary.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-h4</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-h4s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Compatibility and model selection</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p4</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p4s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>The nozzle fits Rain Bird 1800 spray heads and compatible shrub adapters. The 12, 15 and 18 VAN models have matched precipitation rates with MPR nozzles, helping designers combine different arcs and radii on one zone when the hydraulics are correctly sized.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-h5</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-h5s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Design, installation and maintenance</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p5</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p5s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>For system design: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p5s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>provide adequate head-to-head coverage and check dynamic pressure at the nozzle. Explore the </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>a6e7016e-7bba-4078-b76c-6afef30661d6-en-p5s2</_key>
